            "review_title": "Review at Dac San Rung Bien",
            "review_text": "RobertoMR93\nUdine, Italy2 contributions\n1\nBest lunch in Hanoi\nNov 2018 • Solo\nI have spent 10 days in Hanoi in the month of November 2018 and I can say that it is the restaurant where I had the best lunch in the city. The chef suggested me to try chicken with ginger and it was delicious. Personnel is very welcoming and smiling. Location far from old town but well connected and near lake Nghĩa Tân. I would define it a treasure out of the beaten track!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten November 22, 2018",
